01. VPC Peering

Imagine:

VPC-A
10.0.0.0/16

and:

VPC-B
10.1.0.0/16

You want them to communicate.

You can use:

VPC Peering

Architecture:

VPC-A
10.0.0.0/16
     |
     | Peering
     |
     v
VPC-B
10.1.0.0/16

But VPC peering is not transitive.

If:

A <--> B
B <--> C

that doesn't automatically mean:

A <--> C



