03. Transit Gateway

For many VPCs:

VPC-A
   \
VPC-B ---- Transit Gateway
   /
VPC-C
   \
VPC-D

Transit Gateway provides a central connectivity model for many VPCs and other supported networks.

This becomes important in larger enterprises.


04. VPC + EKS:
Since you're learning Kubernetes/EKS, pay special attention here.

Typical architecture:

                     Internet
                        |
                        v
                       ALB
                        |
              +---------+---------+
              |                   |
             AZ-1                AZ-2
              |                   |
        Private Subnet      Private Subnet
              |                   |
          EKS Nodes          EKS Nodes
              |                   |
              +---------+---------+
                        |
                       RDS

EKS networking involves:

VPC
 |
 +-- Subnets
 |
 +-- Route Tables
 |
 +-- Security Groups
 |
 +-- ENIs
 |
 +-- Load Balancers
 |
 +-- Pods

This is why VPC should come before EKS in your learning sequence.
